WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.310 --> 00:00:02.550
Hi, Mystery Recapped here.

00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:09.170
Today I am going to explain a Chinese sci-fi
film called “The Revenge Of Plant.”

00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:10.670
Spoilers ahead!

00:00:10.670 --> 00:00:17.039
Watch out and take care!

00:00:17.039 --> 00:00:20.359
The movie begins at the university of Qingshan.

00:00:20.359 --> 00:00:26.199
Professor Huo Yuchun and his assistant Zheng
Wen are teaching a class about genetic engineering.

00:00:26.199 --> 00:00:29.650
The students take pictures of the board to
go through the notes later.

00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:34.160
One of them, named Luo Ke, takes a picture
of Zheng Wen instead.

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:38.590
She has had a crush on him since she was a
freshman but has never had the courage to

00:00:38.590 --> 00:00:39.590
confess.

00:00:39.590 --> 00:00:44.290
Luo ke’s best friend Lili shows her the
picture of a freshman’s dead body that was

00:00:44.290 --> 00:00:46.760
found in their college that morning.

00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:49.950
They dismiss it as a rumor and continue with
the class.

00:00:49.950 --> 00:00:54.410
Somewhere else, the police take pictures of
the student who died mysteriously.

00:00:54.410 --> 00:00:57.830
His body has turned green almost as if he
was drugged.

00:00:57.830 --> 00:01:03.300
When everyone leaves the class, Luo ke hands
Zheng Wen a plant and confesses her love for

00:01:03.300 --> 00:01:04.300
him.

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:07.369
Zheng Wen, however, rejects her because she
is his student.

00:01:07.369 --> 00:01:13.060
Luo ke expresses her frustration to Lili and
says that she has never been rejected before.

00:01:13.060 --> 00:01:17.939
Her friend suggests she let it go and makes
her dance to a song playing on the radio.

00:01:17.939 --> 00:01:20.899
Zheng Wen sees them dancing and smiles to
himself.

00:01:20.899 --> 00:01:25.700
Following that, Luo ke’s classmate who is
in love with her approaches her with a bouquet

00:01:25.700 --> 00:01:27.090
of flowers.

00:01:27.090 --> 00:01:29.659
Lili leaves them alone and goes to her dorm
room.

00:01:29.659 --> 00:01:37.759
To her surprise, her face is covered with
green pimples that look like budding plants.

00:01:37.759 --> 00:01:39.969
She quickly covers them with makeup.

00:01:39.969 --> 00:01:43.479
Luo ke rejects the guy and makes her way to
the dorm room.

00:01:43.479 --> 00:01:48.049
Meanwhile, Zheng Wen and professor Huo Yuchun
are in the professor’s office.

00:01:48.049 --> 00:01:51.789
The professor offers him a drink that makes
him go unconscious.

00:01:51.789 --> 00:01:56.779
Then he brings out a strange plant with glowing
roots and injects a liquid extracted from

00:01:56.779 --> 00:01:58.330
it, into Zheng Wen’s body.

00:01:58.330 --> 00:02:03.420
He is trying to see if Zheng Wen’s body
is suitable for the plant to grow inside it,

00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:05.950
but the match comes out zero percent.

00:02:05.950 --> 00:02:10.590
The professor leaves the plant and Zheng Wen
in his office and disappears.

00:02:10.590 --> 00:02:15.510
Back in the dorm room, Luo ke notices Lili
acting weird and asks her what is wrong.

00:02:15.510 --> 00:02:19.670
Lili doesn’t show her face and just says
that she needs to rest for a while.

00:02:19.670 --> 00:02:23.730
Luo ke doesn’t disturb her and starts to
paint a picture of Zheng Wen.

00:02:23.730 --> 00:02:32.850
His balcony is visible from their window which
gives Luo ke inspiration for the painting.

00:02:32.850 --> 00:02:36.000
Somewhere else in the hostel, a girl hops
in the shower.

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:40.180
Above her, a Creeping plant slowly covers
the showerhead.

00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:44.250
When she notices it, the water turns green,
making her scream.

00:02:44.250 --> 00:02:48.019
After Luo ke is done with the painting she
decides to give it to Zheng Wen.

00:02:48.019 --> 00:02:50.970
But when she knocks on his doors, no one answers.

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:56.720
Just then, a woman named Shu ManLuo approaches
her and brings out a key from under the mat.

00:02:56.720 --> 00:02:59.700
She unlocks the door and asks her to wait
inside.

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:03.379
At the same time, Zheng Wen wakes up in the
professor’s cabin.

00:03:03.379 --> 00:03:07.180
He is confused as to why he fell asleep but
doesn’t think much of it.

00:03:07.180 --> 00:03:10.099
He takes the plant and returns to his room.

00:03:10.099 --> 00:03:14.340
As the girls wait, Shu ManLuo reveals that
she is Zheng Wen’s ex-girlfriend and they

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:16.209
went to university together.

00:03:16.209 --> 00:03:20.030
Luo ke is hit with a pang of jealousy but
she doesn’t say anything.

00:03:20.030 --> 00:03:24.950
Shu ManLuo leaves after a while asking Luo
ke to tell Zheng Wen she was here.

00:03:24.950 --> 00:03:29.620
After she leaves, Luo ke goes through Zheng
Wen’s belongings and tries different passwords

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:32.060
for his computer.

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:39.420
Soon after, he arrives and is shocked to see
her inside the room.

00:03:39.420 --> 00:03:44.480
Luo ke tells him how she got inside and asks
him why her birthdate is the password to his

00:03:44.480 --> 00:03:48.050
computer.

00:03:48.050 --> 00:03:53.200
Zheng Wen pretends to not know what she is
talking about, so Luo ke also shows him a

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:56.190
picture of her and Lili on his computer.

00:03:56.190 --> 00:04:00.180
He takes her to his balcony and shows her
the plants she has given him throughout the

00:04:00.180 --> 00:04:01.180
years.

00:04:01.180 --> 00:04:06.030
Zheng Wen then brings up Shu ManLuo and explains
how he was in love with her but she got an

00:04:06.030 --> 00:04:09.090
offer to work for a foreign company and dumped
him.

00:04:09.090 --> 00:04:12.340
Luo ke tries to hide her jealousy but fails.

00:04:12.340 --> 00:04:16.890
She runs away from him but he catches up and
says that he, too, likes her but since they

00:04:16.890 --> 00:04:20.620
are teacher and student, he thought the relationship
wouldn’t be appropriate.

00:04:20.620 --> 00:04:25.400
Luo ke suggests they date after she graduates
and Zheng Wen agrees.

00:04:25.400 --> 00:04:29.590
He gives her the plant that he had gotten
from the professor’s office as a token of

00:04:29.590 --> 00:04:30.590
promise.

00:04:30.590 --> 00:04:34.970
After returning to her room, Luo ke waters
the plant but the leaves cut her finger in

00:04:34.970 --> 00:04:36.060
the process.

00:04:36.060 --> 00:04:39.060
She simply puts a bandaid over it while talking
to Lili.

00:04:39.060 --> 00:04:44.430
When her friend doesn’t reply, she assumes
that she slept early and goes to sleep herself.

00:04:44.430 --> 00:04:47.520
The roots of the plant start to glow in the
dark.

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:53.300
Its branches crawl down to the floor and take
over Luo ke’s bed, strangling her in the

00:04:53.300 --> 00:04:54.300
process.

00:04:54.300 --> 00:04:57.340
Luo ke wakes up to realize that it was just
a bad dream.

00:04:57.340 --> 00:05:01.220
Then, she notices green liquid dripping from
Lili’s bed.

00:05:01.220 --> 00:05:04.990
She carefully removes the curtains and discovers
Lili’s dead body.

00:05:04.990 --> 00:05:08.080
Her back had started to grow plants from it.

00:05:08.080 --> 00:05:10.979
The sight makes Luo ke scream in fear.

00:05:10.979 --> 00:05:14.870
Soon, the news travels around and the police
are called to investigate.

00:05:14.870 --> 00:05:19.940
Zheng Wen finds out about the incident and
runs to see if Luo ke is okay.

00:05:19.940 --> 00:05:24.569
The police officer shows Zheng Wen a plant
that was found in Lili’s body and asks for

00:05:24.569 --> 00:05:26.150
his expert advice.

00:05:26.150 --> 00:05:31.320
Zheng Wen is confused because the plant looks
like a gymnosperm but has a kind of root that

00:05:31.320 --> 00:05:33.310
he has never seen in his life.

00:05:33.310 --> 00:05:37.360
While waiting for the police to get done,
Luo ke sees Shu ManLuo in the crowd.

00:05:37.360 --> 00:05:41.599
Zheng Wen then takes her to the canteen to
feed her something since she hasn’t eaten

00:05:41.599 --> 00:05:42.940
since the morning.

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:47.590
It is announced that the university premises
will go into a complete lockdown because of

00:05:47.590 --> 00:05:50.780
a virus that has been discovered in some of
the students.

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:55.530
All the students and teachers are asked not
to leave the university without permission.

00:05:55.530 --> 00:06:00.610
When Luo ke and Zheng Wen walk out of the
building, Luo ke hallucinates about plants

00:06:00.610 --> 00:06:04.770
taking over the university but quickly comes
back to reality.

00:06:04.770 --> 00:06:08.260
At the cafeteria, they hear the news about
professor Huo’s disappearance.

00:06:08.260 --> 00:06:14.400
He is accused of endangering public health
by introducing his students to a deadly virus.

00:06:14.400 --> 00:06:18.930
Luo ke remembers that Lili has a boyfriend
who she called “H” who helped her pay

00:06:18.930 --> 00:06:20.200
for her tuition.

00:06:20.200 --> 00:06:23.270
She believes that H had to do something with
her death.

00:06:23.270 --> 00:06:27.660
She then goes to the washroom where the bandaid
from her finger moves showing that the cut

00:06:27.660 --> 00:06:29.870
has started to grow a plant out of it.

00:06:29.870 --> 00:06:31.690
She panics and plucks it out.

00:06:31.690 --> 00:06:37.470
A man in a PPE set and a face mask approaches
her and Zheng Wen and asks them to go to the

00:06:37.470 --> 00:06:41.780
gymnasium as soon as possible to get tested
and decontaminated.

00:06:41.780 --> 00:06:46.930
An announcement is made throughout the university
asking everyone to gather in the gymnasium.

00:06:46.930 --> 00:06:52.129
Policemen surround the premises wearing poison
masks which scares the students even more.

00:06:52.129 --> 00:06:56.960
On their way to the gymnasium, they come across
Shu ManLuo who reveals that she is a professional

00:06:56.960 --> 00:06:59.849
called to investigate the cases of infection.

00:06:59.849 --> 00:07:04.430
She represents a multi-millionaire pharmaceutical
company and has been working closely with

00:07:04.430 --> 00:07:09.330
professor Huo for a synthetic gene reorganization
research project.

00:07:09.330 --> 00:07:14.160
She found out that the professor’s experiments
deviated from the scientific research ethics.

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:19.289
He started to reorganize animal genetics and
plant genetics to create harmful viruses.

00:07:19.289 --> 00:07:23.349
When she confronted him, he dismissed her
and didn’t stop the experiments.

00:07:23.349 --> 00:07:27.960
He even started to use his students as test
subjects which caused the outbreak of the

00:07:27.960 --> 00:07:28.960
virus.

00:07:28.960 --> 00:07:33.919
As Shu Manlou and Zheng Wen talk about the
experiments, Luo ke notices her nerves turning

00:07:33.919 --> 00:07:34.919
green.

00:07:34.919 --> 00:07:39.159
She registers that she has been infected by
the virus and runs away to hide.

00:07:39.159 --> 00:07:43.020
Zheng Wen notices after some seconds and starts
to look for her.

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:47.699
Meanwhile, the girl who was attacked by plants
earlier is restrained by the officers for

00:07:47.699 --> 00:07:48.990
being infected.

00:07:48.990 --> 00:07:52.819
She is given medical assistance but the virus
kills her eventually.

00:07:52.819 --> 00:07:56.139
Zheng Wen goes to his room and finds Luo Ke
there.

00:07:56.139 --> 00:07:59.500
She asks him to stay away and shows him the
infected arm.

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:02.669
He also notices that her face is glowing green.

00:08:02.669 --> 00:08:10.840
Luo ke then opens Lili’s myspace and reads
the notes that she used to write every day.

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:15.580
The note mentions a man named H who used to
take her to his house that had the view of

00:08:15.580 --> 00:08:16.840
a lighthouse.

00:08:16.840 --> 00:08:20.259
She also talks about a plant that H gave her
as a gift.

00:08:20.259 --> 00:08:24.370
They assume that H is none other than professor
Huo himself.

00:08:24.370 --> 00:08:29.440
Just then, some men in PPE suits come to the
dorms to disinfect the hallways.

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:32.380
They ask anyone who is still inside the room
to come out.

00:08:32.380 --> 00:08:37.289
Zheng Wen and Luo ke are scared that if they
find out Luo ke is infected, they will make

00:08:37.289 --> 00:08:40.110
her the test subject of their experiments.

00:08:40.110 --> 00:08:43.260
Therefore they decide to hide until the men
leave.

00:08:43.260 --> 00:08:48.290
However, Luo ke accidentally drops a glass
of water and gives away their presence.

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:51.970
The men take both of them to the gymnasium
to test them.

00:08:51.970 --> 00:08:56.390
After finding out that Luo ke is infected,
they sedate her with a tranquilizer and take

00:08:56.390 --> 00:08:57.390
her away.

00:08:57.390 --> 00:09:01.910
Later, a group of officials interrogates Shu
Manlou about the virus.

00:09:01.910 --> 00:09:06.170
She briefs them that the virus can affect
a human’s brain and nervous system.

00:09:06.170 --> 00:09:11.399
However, it isn’t contagious and can only
transmit through direct contact with the infected

00:09:11.399 --> 00:09:12.399
plant.

00:09:12.399 --> 00:09:16.279
The officials assume that this means the cases
of infection are similar to poisoning and

00:09:16.279 --> 00:09:18.060
there is nothing to worry about.

00:09:18.060 --> 00:09:22.690
According to Shu Manlou, Luo ke’s genetics
are very well matched to give rise to a new

00:09:22.690 --> 00:09:28.100
form of a variable of the virus that might
be extremely dangerous even though it is not

00:09:28.100 --> 00:09:29.100
contagious.

00:09:29.100 --> 00:09:34.459
The men do not take her warnings seriously
and decide that they are going to lift the

00:09:34.459 --> 00:09:35.459
lockdown.

00:09:35.459 --> 00:09:40.500
Outside, Zheng Wen meets Shu Manlou and the
two decide to go to the place that Lili talked

00:09:40.500 --> 00:09:41.930
about in her journal.

00:09:41.930 --> 00:09:45.880
They assume that the place is the professor’s
lab where they can find more information about

00:09:45.880 --> 00:09:48.490
the experiments he performed on the students.

00:09:48.490 --> 00:09:52.600
They finally reach the house and see it has
been taken over by the plants.

00:09:52.600 --> 00:09:55.270
The professor is sitting motionless on a chair.

00:09:55.270 --> 00:10:00.110
When the two approach him, a gigantic venus
fly trap emerges from his back and almost

00:10:00.110 --> 00:10:01.110
kills them.

00:10:01.110 --> 00:10:06.279
Shu Manlou lights the plant on fire and kills
the professor alongside it.

00:10:06.279 --> 00:10:10.240
Then, she goes through the professor’s computer
and finds out that if the virus’s growing

00:10:10.240 --> 00:10:16.560
condition matches 100% with someone’s genetics,
it will give rise to a never-dying plant that

00:10:16.560 --> 00:10:21.010
will grow at an exponential rate and can cover
cities, if not countries.

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:25.490
Similarly, if zero percent of the genetics
match, then the person would be immune to

00:10:25.490 --> 00:10:27.240
the virus altogether.

00:10:27.240 --> 00:10:31.540
At the beginning of the movie, Zheng Wen’s
genetics had matched zero percent, explaining

00:10:31.540 --> 00:10:35.220
the reason he hasn’t been infected, even
though the professor injected him with the

00:10:35.220 --> 00:10:36.740
virus directly.

00:10:36.740 --> 00:10:41.490
Shu Manlou tries to retrieve data from the
computer to send it back to the company she

00:10:41.490 --> 00:10:42.610
works for.

00:10:42.610 --> 00:10:46.660
Zheng Wen is against it since a lot of people
have died because of the experiment and the

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:49.779
information might put more lives in danger.

00:10:49.779 --> 00:10:53.380
When he stops her, Shu Manlou attacks him
with pepper spray.

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:58.440
But before she can run away, a branch grows
from the Venus flytrap and kills her.

00:10:58.440 --> 00:11:02.880
Back in the gymnasium, we see that Luo ke’s
genetics have matched hundred percent suitable

00:11:02.880 --> 00:11:04.500
for the virus’s growth.

00:11:04.500 --> 00:11:09.139
Like the professor had predicted, she starts
to grow a never-ending dense crawler plant

00:11:09.139 --> 00:11:11.990
from her body and takes over the gymnasium.

00:11:11.990 --> 00:11:16.029
The medical professionals helping her are
also killed in the process.

00:11:16.029 --> 00:11:21.250
When Zheng Wen returns to the university,
he finds everyone dead but Luo ke is nowhere

00:11:21.250 --> 00:11:22.380
to be found.

00:11:22.380 --> 00:11:26.149
We are then shown that the entire city has
been taken over by the plant.

00:11:26.149 --> 00:11:30.709
Several months after the incident, Zheng Wen
returns to the university still looking for

00:11:30.709 --> 00:11:31.870
Luo ke.

00:11:31.870 --> 00:11:35.350
He notices the painting that she made of him
on the classroom’s wall.

00:11:35.350 --> 00:11:41.130
In the last scene, Zheng Wen looks behind
and smiles, presumably because he saw Luo

00:11:41.130 --> 00:11:42.130
ke.

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:46.060
